、学園中憧れの『お姉様』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生真面目で、自分にも他人にも厳しい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体の弱い舞依を思い、由宇の子供を自分が産むと決心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"受動的なＭ気質だが、最近は積極的にエッチを仕掛けるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、もともと男女関係に疎く、アプローチが迷走気味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外伝では主人公。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1405","sourceWorkId":"19164","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"リリエンヌ女学園３年生"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞依の姉でリリエンヌ女学園の学園執行部部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞依と同じく、由宇のお嫁さん候補の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐こい舞依とは対照的に、生真面目であまり人を寄せ付けないタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由宇に協力しようとする妹を心配するあまり、自らも協力する事になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチは受動的で、M気質。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200817"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1405","sourceWorkId":"13759","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1405","sourceWorkId":"13759","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1405","sourceWorkId":"13759","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1405","sourceWorkId":"13759","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/15a67abde6be2771f519ae418bfe4f5b915945d1274f6f669dee9539c261bd19.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63c16f5977f3f3248eaee3f6e3dfc973b3e9ba669db8102dd788807bea746b84.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voic